WEBVTT

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:14.280
Hello. I'm Hinagiku Katsura.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.990
<b>Hinagiku Katsura</b>

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:19.910
I'm the student council president 
at Hakuo Academy, and...

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:23.750
Big sister, what are you 
going to use this for?

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.810
Uh, for a school guide!

00:00:25.810 --> 00:00:28.900
You know, for kids trying to 
get into this school next year.

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:32.010
Okay, change into this for 
your cute underclassmen!

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.010
A... swimsuit?

00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:37.050
Why should I wear this?!

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.980
<b>Hinagiku Katsura's Forbidden Swimsuit DVD
  Full of priceless footage! 
 Accepting pre-orders now!</b>

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:41.480
"Hinagiku Katsura's 
Forbidden Swimsuit DVD."

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:43.980
"Accepting pre-orders now."

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:47.900
A-Actually, I used up my 
paycheck for the month,

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:49.720
so I thought I'd make 
some money with this...

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:52.000
Big sister, are you familiar 
with usage rights?

00:00:52.490 --> 00:00:54.400
Selling another person's image...

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:56.770
...is a crime.

00:00:57.880 --> 00:01:00.160
Do you really want to be a criminal?

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:03.330
Stingy Hina!

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:05.290
Short-tempered! Flat-chested!

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:10.290
Be a little more fragile! You call yourself a girl?!

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:10.290
Oh, shut up!

00:02:59.810 --> 00:03:01.240
Honestly...

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:04.660
Even I have my fragile side.

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:08.220
Hold it right there!

00:03:08.850 --> 00:03:11.020
This way, Demon-san!

00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:12.170
You little... Wait!

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:14.130
Come on, Izumi!

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:18.320
You girls seem awfully carefree.

00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:21.050
Didn't you fail that last test?

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:24.180
Yeah. That's why we 
met up here to study.

00:03:28.030 --> 00:03:29.550
Oh, Hinagiku-san.

00:03:30.220 --> 00:03:31.570
You were here?

00:03:31.570 --> 00:03:33.900
Kaoru-sensei asked me to give you these.

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:35.810
Thank you.

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:38.310
If there's anything you 
don't understand, ask me.

00:03:38.310 --> 00:03:39.400
Okay!

00:03:39.810 --> 00:03:44.160
Hayata-kun, rub my shoulders. 
They're so stiff from studying.

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:46.580
Studying? What kind of joke is that?

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:48.950
You don't live the kind of lives that 
would make your shoulders stiff.

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:51.090
The kitten has claws! 
And he's talking down to us!

00:03:51.090 --> 00:03:53.130
You're supposed to be nice to girls!

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:56.270
Okay, fine...

00:03:57.290 --> 00:03:59.160
That's nice, Hayata-kun...

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:05.940
<i>I can't believe Miki 
made him do that...</i>

00:04:08.450 --> 00:04:09.710
Lucky her...

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:12.860
<i>If I asked Hayate-kun, 
I wonder if he'd...</i>

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:17.570
<i>N-No way! I'd be too 
embarrassed to ask for that!</i>

00:04:19.220 --> 00:04:20.290
<i>Which means...</i>

00:04:22.920 --> 00:04:27.740
<i>If Hayate-kun were to ask me, 
"Shall I rub your shoulders?"</i>

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:28.740
<i>Then I could say...</i>

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:29.870
<i>"Please do!"</i>

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:32.060
<i>And that's all it would take!</i>

00:04:32.610 --> 00:04:34.120
<i>The problem is...</i>

00:04:34.590 --> 00:04:38.380
My shoulders never seem 
to get stiff at all...

00:04:39.890 --> 00:04:43.010
At times like this, I hate 
myself for being so strong.

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:48.580
Should I just openly ask him, 
"Rub them for me"?

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:52.020
But knowing Hayate-kun...

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:54.590
Rub? Do you mean your breasts?

00:04:54.590 --> 00:04:57.520
Even if I do, your breasts 
won't get any bigger.

00:04:57.810 --> 00:05:00.370
<i>That's totally what he'd say!</i>

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:04.780
<i>Hayate-kun doesn't even 
treat me like a girl.</i>

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:11.580
<b>Be Careful with Fire</b>

00:05:09.150 --> 00:05:10.870
You're really quite stiff.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:16.000
Well, I'm a fragile 
young girl too, after all.

00:05:17.410 --> 00:05:18.500
<i>O-Of course.</i>

00:05:18.850 --> 00:05:20.800
<i>He's the butler for the whole apartment.</i>

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:22.420
<i>He'd do that for anyone living here.</i>

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:25.630
<i>Then I guess I can be a little
 bit girly and needy with him...</i>

00:05:26.540 --> 00:05:27.970
Hayate-kun...

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:29.000
Oh?

00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:32.990
You've got a bit of number 104 
screen tone stuck here somehow.

00:05:33.570 --> 00:05:37.040
Huh? Oh, yeah. I was helping 
Nagi with her manga earlier.

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:38.390
It's even on your forehead.

00:05:39.350 --> 00:05:41.110
Please hold still.

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:43.570
N-No!

00:05:43.870 --> 00:05:44.680
Huh?

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:47.340
Really, you should be 
picking that off yourself!

00:05:47.340 --> 00:05:48.570
It's unsightly!

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:52.030
Y-Yeah, you're right...

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:54.910
And Hayate-kun, you 
shouldn't just go along

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:56.980
with everything a girl tells you to do.

00:05:56.980 --> 00:05:59.120
A butler isn't one who just pampers girls.

00:05:59.850 --> 00:06:01.040
Sorry...

00:06:01.450 --> 00:06:04.670
<i>Darn it! I raised my own 
hurdle even higher!</i>

00:06:05.280 --> 00:06:07.900
Hayate-kun, I'm sorry,

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:10.540
but would you go buy some 
carrots and onions for me, please?

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:12.180
We're having curry tonight!

00:06:12.630 --> 00:06:14.380
Yes, certainly.

00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:17.820
Maria-san, Nagi, you're 
staying here today?

00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:19.140
Yeah, since it's the weekend.

00:06:19.140 --> 00:06:20.860
Oh, yes, Hinagiku-san...

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:23.650
If you don't mind, could you 
help me study this evening?

00:06:25.270 --> 00:06:28.200
I managed to get through the last test,

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:29.970
but Hakuo is a tough school...

00:06:29.970 --> 00:06:30.990
<i>This is it!</i>

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:33.420
<i>This is my chance!</i>

00:06:35.820 --> 00:06:40.040
<i>If I act like my shoulders are stiff, 
he should offer to rub them.</i>

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:41.910
<i>Just watch!</i>

00:06:41.910 --> 00:06:44.800
<i>I'll make him say it 
with my subtle hints!</i>

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:48.760
<i>Subtle hint #1: Casually 
rub my own shoulders.</i>

00:06:49.270 --> 00:06:52.390
<i>#2: Proceed to rotating 
my shoulders broadly.</i>

00:06:52.860 --> 00:06:55.970
<i>#3: Rotate my neck along 
with my shoulders.</i>

00:06:57.260 --> 00:07:00.520
<i>Not bad! You've dodged 
all my subtle hints!</i>

00:07:01.010 --> 00:07:04.320
<i>Then, I'll show you my final attack...</i>

00:07:05.160 --> 00:07:08.400
Ah, my shoulders are kinda stiff...

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:11.950
<i>How's that?! If I say it out loud,
 even Hayate-kun can't...</i>

00:07:12.650 --> 00:07:13.660
Hinagiku-san...

00:07:14.170 --> 00:07:18.080
Look! When you read this 
vertically, it says "stupid"!

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:19.830
Who cares?!

00:07:20.390 --> 00:07:23.880
<i>All you had to do was ask, 
"Are your shoulders stiff?"</i>

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:27.530
By the way, Hinagiku-san, 
are your shoulders stiff?

00:07:28.180 --> 00:07:30.160
<i>Those are the words 
I've been waiting for!</i>

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:31.340
Of course...

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:33.390
...my shoulders aren't stiff!

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:37.260
Yes, you're right.

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:40.420
You're a very strong, 
Spartan kind of person,

00:07:40.420 --> 00:07:43.790
who's strong enough to know 
nothing of such weaknesses.

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:50.150
<i>I couldn't say it in the end...</i>

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:52.340
Guessing from that sigh,

00:07:52.340 --> 00:07:55.810
you gave Hayate lots of 
subtle hints that you wanted him

00:07:55.810 --> 00:07:57.710
to rub your shoulders,

00:07:57.710 --> 00:07:59.660
but it all ended in vain.

00:08:00.260 --> 00:08:01.350
Is that right?

00:08:02.060 --> 00:08:03.170
<i>How does she know?!</i>

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:07.460
It must be difficult for 
maidens of that age...

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:08.670
But don't run away.

00:08:09.160 --> 00:08:11.290
Try hinting to him once more.

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:19.250
U-Um, Hayate-kun, are you there?

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:20.560
I wanted to ask—

00:08:22.720 --> 00:08:24.560
He must've gone back to the mansion...

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:28.770
"A maiden," huh?

00:08:29.390 --> 00:08:34.290
I guess Hayate-kun really 
doesn't think of me as a girl...

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:38.700
Hayate-kun

00:08:37.630 --> 00:08:38.700
Hayate-kun?!

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:40.270
Hello?

00:08:40.270 --> 00:08:42.300
Hinagiku-san, sorry to call so suddenly.

00:08:42.300 --> 00:08:43.660
Can we meet up as soon as possible?

00:08:43.840 --> 00:08:44.570
What?

00:08:44.570 --> 00:08:46.160
If it's not too much trouble,

00:08:46.160 --> 00:08:47.920
please come to the following 
location immediately.

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:49.530
Got it!

00:08:55.930 --> 00:09:00.360
So, could you explain to me 
what this is about, Hayate-kun?

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:02.220
Well...

00:09:02.590 --> 00:09:06.610
This is a resort on the 
Sanzenin family's property.

00:09:06.610 --> 00:09:08.440
It's Sea Disgaea.

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:10.110
Uh huh. And?

00:09:10.370 --> 00:09:14.110
And they just insisted 
that we call you here...

00:09:14.260 --> 00:09:17.110
Hey, hey, Hina-chan!

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:18.960
Why are you three here?!

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:21.940
Well, we were all studying 
hard again today...

00:09:21.940 --> 00:09:24.940
But our shoulders got stiff, 
so we barged in to take a swim!

00:09:25.590 --> 00:09:26.580
Is that right?

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:28.780
Come on, Hina-chan, play with us!

00:09:29.730 --> 00:09:31.750
You've got it rough, Hayate-kun.

00:09:32.140 --> 00:09:36.430
Not at all. They said they'll all 
leave if you play with them.

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:37.590
So...

00:09:38.210 --> 00:09:40.600
Would you go change into 
this swimsuit right away?

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:42.100
Oh, my...

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:44.260
Hayate-kun, you idiot!

00:09:44.260 --> 00:09:46.060
You don't even understand...

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:47.370
Hinagiku-san?

00:09:48.320 --> 00:09:50.810
Serves you right, indebted butler!

00:09:51.180 --> 00:09:52.190
That voice...

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:56.240
If you're so whipped by a girl 
like that, then you might as well...

00:09:56.680 --> 00:09:59.230
fall before me!

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:00.720
And...

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:02.090
Who's this guy?

00:10:02.090 --> 00:10:03.790
Beats me.

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:10.460
I am the one purusing the Sanzenin fortune, one of the Lucky Clovers, Gilbert!

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:08.820
<b>Lucky Clovers</b>

00:10:10.850 --> 00:10:12.800
Today's the day I will defeat 
that indebted butler—

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:16.460
For someone with such a cute face, 
you're ruthless, Hayate-kun...

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:19.960
So how much more do I have to 
beat you up before you go home?

00:10:18.670 --> 00:10:20.800
No, no! Violence is bad!

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:24.060
A handicap... Give me a handicap!

00:10:24.430 --> 00:10:28.190
This blond just said something really 
weird with that handsome face...

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:30.670
Does this blond have no pride?

00:10:30.670 --> 00:10:33.440
It's a given that I can't win 
in a contest of brute strength!

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:36.070
So please, give me 
just a little service!

00:10:36.070 --> 00:10:37.810
What do you mean by a "handicap"?

00:10:37.810 --> 00:10:40.700
Oh, nubile maid! I'm glad you asked!

00:10:41.360 --> 00:10:42.830
Nubile?

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:45.360
This just happens to be 
an artificial beach.

00:10:45.360 --> 00:10:48.320
So how about a beach 
volleyball contest?

00:10:48.320 --> 00:10:49.550
Beach volleyball?

00:10:49.550 --> 00:10:52.840
Yes! If you win, I will go home!

00:10:53.110 --> 00:10:54.600
This is stupid.

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:57.840
Why do we always have to 
compete on your terms?

00:10:58.170 --> 00:11:00.590
Ah, I see.

00:11:00.990 --> 00:11:03.850
You are a spineless brat, as always.

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:06.520
If you can't accept such 
a simple compromise,

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:08.350
then the Sanzenin butler must be

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:11.390
no more than a weak, third rate butler!

00:11:11.390 --> 00:11:13.120
Fine then, I accept!

00:11:13.120 --> 00:11:15.380
Hayate will never lose 
to the likes of you!

00:11:15.380 --> 00:11:16.530
Stupid! Stupid! <i>Stupid!</i>

00:11:16.010 --> 00:11:17.390
Wait, Miss Nagi...

00:11:17.390 --> 00:11:19.990
I've had enough of this. Just do it.

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:21.110
You too, Maria-san?

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:25.340
Then that's that. 
We'll compete two on two.

00:11:25.340 --> 00:11:26.150
Two on two?

00:11:26.150 --> 00:11:28.790
Yes! Since I can't beat you one on one,

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:31.940
I will team up with this person!

00:11:33.630 --> 00:11:35.310
Hello! I'm Eight! Long time no see!

00:11:35.310 --> 00:11:38.130
No, this time I'm Volleyball 
Pro 2000GT. I love volleyball!

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:41.170
Wait a minute, 
that's clearly not a person!

00:11:41.170 --> 00:11:45.080
I will play against you and whichever 
one of those people I choose!

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:45.720
What?

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:47.880
Oh! Beach volleyball with Hayata-kun!

00:11:47.880 --> 00:11:50.180
That sounds fun! I'll play!

00:11:50.700 --> 00:11:53.440
<i>Looks like I'll lose no 
matter who I pick...</i>

00:11:54.510 --> 00:11:57.490
Then you should pair with the one 
who looks the most fragile...

00:11:57.490 --> 00:12:00.940
That red-haired girl over there!

00:12:01.300 --> 00:12:03.200
What? Me?

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:08.490
<i>Did that foreigner just 
throw the match?</i>

00:12:08.860 --> 00:12:11.000
<i>He's totally digging his own grave.</i>

00:12:11.340 --> 00:12:12.480
We've won this.

00:12:12.480 --> 00:12:13.250
Yes.

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:16.750
Hm? Why? What is this in the air?

00:12:17.030 --> 00:12:20.200
Are you telling me this 
girl is not fragile?

00:12:21.870 --> 00:12:23.710
What are you talking about?

00:12:23.710 --> 00:12:27.260
Of course, Hinagiku-san 
is a very fragile girl!

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:30.020
<i>Hayate-kun...</i>

00:12:30.300 --> 00:12:33.000
Of course she is! Right, everyone?

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:34.850
Yeah! She's fragile! She's fragile!

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:36.730
Hina-chan is super fragile!

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:38.040
Really?

00:12:38.780 --> 00:12:41.400
Then, I guess I'll play
 beach volleyball.

00:12:41.720 --> 00:12:43.900
Yes. Please do.

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:47.030
<b>Commercial Connecting Theater</b>

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:47.030
Commercial Connecting Theater!

00:12:47.230 --> 00:12:50.030
Today, we're at Yukari-chan's house...

00:12:50.030 --> 00:12:52.930
to wake up Hina with a practical joke!

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:56.580
She's sleeping, she's sleeping!

00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:58.710
So, what kind of prank should we play?

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:03.880
But, Doughnut Sergeant, 
then the citizens will...

00:13:04.910 --> 00:13:06.190
Doughnut...

00:13:06.190 --> 00:13:07.600
...Sergeant?

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:10.930
<b>Commercial Connecting Theater</b>

00:13:08.490 --> 00:13:10.930
It's Commercial Connecting Theater!

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:15.980
Second Lieutenant Hinagiku, 
the imperial forces are nearly upon us.

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:18.310
I will draw away the 
enemy, so you must...

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:19.860
That's insane!

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:22.740
Your aircraft can only fly 
for another five minutes!

00:13:23.050 --> 00:13:27.340
Five minutes is enough to protect 
the future for you and the children.

00:13:28.260 --> 00:13:30.300
But, Sergeant...

00:13:30.300 --> 00:13:32.140
That sergeant's a pretty nice guy.

00:13:32.140 --> 00:13:34.370
Yeah, I want to know 
what happens next...

00:13:38.190 --> 00:13:40.640
We've got the court ready...

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:42.930
Hinagiku-san is late.

00:13:42.930 --> 00:13:44.880
Miki, why do you have a camera?

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:46.330
Did you forget?

00:13:46.330 --> 00:13:48.390
They're about to play beach volleyball.

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:49.890
Which means Hina will...

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:52.760
Oh, she'll be in a swimsuit. I get it.

00:13:52.760 --> 00:13:54.490
What are you going to 
film on that camera?

00:13:54.490 --> 00:13:56.740
Wow! Hina-chan!

00:13:57.770 --> 00:14:00.650
I just changed. How's this?

00:14:00.990 --> 00:14:02.980
You're so cute, Hina-chan!

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:04.420
Really? I'm glad.

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:06.400
Yeah! It looks great on you!

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:08.130
Where's the swimsuit?!

00:14:08.130 --> 00:14:09.160
Wh-What?

00:14:09.430 --> 00:14:10.470
You need a swimsuit!

00:14:10.470 --> 00:14:13.530
Common sense says you must play 
beach volleyball in a swimsuit!

00:14:13.530 --> 00:14:16.580
Why? It doesn't have to be in swimsuit.

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:20.050
Right, Hayate-kun? 
It doesn't have to be, right?

00:14:19.810 --> 00:14:21.750
Give us back our excitement!

00:14:20.050 --> 00:14:21.750
Right, of course.

00:14:22.360 --> 00:14:25.460
That looks very good on you. 
Let's both play our best.

00:14:26.360 --> 00:14:28.190
Yeah. I will.

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:33.220
Then, shall we begin this 
one-time-only beach volleyball battle?

00:14:33.480 --> 00:14:35.450
Yes, whenever you're ready.

00:14:35.820 --> 00:14:39.520
<i>We've won this! Considering 
Hinagiku-san's athletic ability...</i>

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:42.790
<i>That's right.</i>

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:47.440
<i>One way or another, 
he thought of me as a fragile girl.</i>

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:49.530
<i>All right! I'll go all out!</i>

00:14:50.010 --> 00:14:52.210
Maybe you'll try too hard,

00:14:52.210 --> 00:14:54.280
and then he'll think 
you're not fragile at all.

00:14:56.930 --> 00:14:58.040
My God!

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:00.270
Yay! Go, go!

00:15:00.270 --> 00:15:03.080
How was that, Hayate-kun? 
I was amazing, right?

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:06.300
Yes, you certainly were... but...

00:15:07.570 --> 00:15:10.300
Hinagiku-san... 
you were like a wild beast.

00:15:12.740 --> 00:15:14.640
<i>N-No, Hinagiku!</i>

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:18.560
<i>If you try hard now, everything 
will go back to square one!</i>

00:15:18.880 --> 00:15:21.860
<i>I have to be more modest, 
more feminine...</i>

00:15:21.860 --> 00:15:22.990
Here it comes!

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:28.070
<i>No! I can't try hard! 
Because right now...</i>

00:15:28.670 --> 00:15:30.570
<i>I'm a fragile girl!</i>

00:15:31.090 --> 00:15:32.530
What?! Hinagiku-san?!

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:35.030
Ouch!

00:15:38.030 --> 00:15:40.290
<i>Wh-What...</i>

00:15:40.670 --> 00:15:42.540
<i>...was that?</i>

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:46.670
Ouch! I can't stop that!

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:49.920
Um, are you okay, Hinagiku-san?

00:15:50.160 --> 00:15:54.050
Ow, ow, ow. I might not be okay.

00:15:54.520 --> 00:15:58.310
I'm a fragile girl, after all.

00:16:01.260 --> 00:16:04.560
<i>What's going on? Hinagiku-san 
is acting different from usual...</i>

00:16:05.450 --> 00:16:08.440
<i>Come to think of it, she was 
moving around strangely last night.</i>

00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:11.390
It couldn't be... Hinagiku-san,
 are you not feeling...

00:16:11.390 --> 00:16:15.620
I knew from the moment I saw 
her that she was fragile.

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:16.460
What?

00:16:17.020 --> 00:16:18.620
Because she...

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:21.290
...has a surprising lack of breasts.

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:26.630
One look at those puny breasts and 
it's obvious that she's a weakling!

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:30.980
Wh-Who are you calling a weakling?!

00:16:32.020 --> 00:16:33.930
Do you want me to say it over and over?

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:37.180
I'll show you I'm not a weakling—

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:39.710
<i>N-No!</i>

00:16:39.710 --> 00:16:42.120
<i>It's because I get so 
competitive in these situations</i>

00:16:42.120 --> 00:16:44.190
<i>that I don't look like a fragile girl!</i>

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:46.440
I...

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:48.750
I am a weakling. So what?

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:51.150
You sure are!

00:16:51.470 --> 00:16:56.120
Now, shall I show you what my 
volleyball machine can really do?

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:58.620
<i>If I could show him what I can do...</i>

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:00.120
I'm sorry, Hinagiku-san.

00:17:01.050 --> 00:17:02.670
This is my fault.

00:17:02.670 --> 00:17:05.250
I had no idea you were 
in poor condition.

00:17:05.650 --> 00:17:09.050
I just assumed that 
I could win with you,

00:17:09.050 --> 00:17:10.500
and now I've put you in danger...

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:12.510
Hayate-kun...

00:17:16.030 --> 00:17:19.260
<i>I believe we are offered 
several choices in life.</i>

00:17:21.820 --> 00:17:23.530
<i>Do I want you to like me?</i>

00:17:25.780 --> 00:17:27.450
<i>Do I want to help you?</i>

00:17:28.570 --> 00:17:33.690
Now, along with that flat-chested weakling, 
you will become sand on the beach!

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:38.660
<i>Or do I want to beat 
this guy senseless?</i>

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:41.620
And now, you die!

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:49.470
What?! My Volleyball Pro 2000GT!

00:17:49.470 --> 00:17:52.950
You flat-chested wench! 
Just who are you?!

00:17:52.950 --> 00:17:53.880
Me?

00:17:54.770 --> 00:17:57.340
My name is Hinagiku Katsura.

00:17:57.700 --> 00:18:01.220
Hakuo Academy's Student Council 
President, Hinagiku Katsura!

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:04.730
I don't lose in any contest!

00:18:07.450 --> 00:18:09.980
Why, you... In that case...

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:10.770
Come!

00:18:11.260 --> 00:18:14.030
My volleyball robot army, Blaster!

00:18:14.390 --> 00:18:17.100
Now we get started for real! 
Let's go, Hayate-kun!

00:18:17.100 --> 00:18:17.780
Yes!

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:22.990
They're both so cool!

00:18:22.990 --> 00:18:25.820
Wasn't this supposed to 
be beach volleyball?

00:18:25.820 --> 00:18:29.790
I didn't know the goal of beach volleyball
 was to knock down the opponent with the ball.

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:33.360
Um, did anyone here know 
the rules in the first place?

00:18:33.360 --> 00:18:35.810
That's it! Go get 'em, Hayate!

00:18:36.350 --> 00:18:38.050
I guess not.

00:18:41.790 --> 00:18:44.380
Now all that's left is 
you and one more robot.

00:18:44.380 --> 00:18:45.860
Want to keep this up?

00:18:45.860 --> 00:18:47.560
In that case...

00:18:47.560 --> 00:18:51.560
You've committed a major 
violation of this game's rules!

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:53.090
Huh?

00:18:53.090 --> 00:18:53.820
What?

00:18:54.160 --> 00:18:55.600
<i>N-Now he says this?</i>

00:18:55.600 --> 00:18:58.570
<i>Were they even following 
any rules at all?</i>

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:02.070
What?! Where exactly 
did we violate a rule?!

00:19:02.070 --> 00:19:04.700
<i>Uh, are you seriously asking this?</i>

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:07.710
You did violate the rules! Because...

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:11.440
You're not playing in a swimsuit!

00:19:13.700 --> 00:19:15.640
Beach volleyball must 
be played in a swimsuit!

00:19:15.640 --> 00:19:18.740
The rules say that girls 
have to play in swimsuits!

00:19:18.740 --> 00:19:20.050
Where is that written?!

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:21.360
He's right!

00:19:21.360 --> 00:19:23.930
How is it beach volleyball if 
you don't play in a swimsuit?!

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:25.050
Don't underestimate the beach!

00:19:24.710 --> 00:19:26.060
You, shut up!

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:30.350
<i>Of course, I intended to 
participate wearing a swimsuit.</i>

00:19:31.660 --> 00:19:34.060
<i>But, in front of Hayate-kun...</i>

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:36.340
<i>I can't wear a swimsuit...</i>

00:19:38.410 --> 00:19:42.040
<i>So, just as I thought, 
she is a shy girl.</i>

00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:44.600
<i>If she doesn't change into a 
swimsuit, I win the match.</i>

00:19:44.600 --> 00:19:49.330
<i>And even if she changes, 
she'll be too embarrassed to perform!</i>

00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:49.330
Illustration of 
being too embarrassed
to perform

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:53.260
What a perfect plan!

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:55.590
My victory is already assured!

00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:59.090
Nothing is assured!

00:19:59.570 --> 00:20:00.590
Hinagiku-san!

00:20:02.570 --> 00:20:05.390
My name is Hinagiku Katsura.

00:20:05.670 --> 00:20:08.890
I don't lose in any contest!

00:20:09.650 --> 00:20:11.020
But dressed like that...

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:14.980
Can you really show 
your true strength?!

00:20:17.250 --> 00:20:19.150
Shut up!

00:20:19.680 --> 00:20:21.610
She showed it, all right.

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:23.410
She certainly did.

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:27.100
Don't you forget this!

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:30.330
Hinagiku-san.

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:34.830
Thank you. I was able 
to win because of you.

00:20:35.770 --> 00:20:37.580
No, it wasn't...

00:20:39.020 --> 00:20:42.470
By the way, this is just how I feel...

00:20:45.650 --> 00:20:48.680
You need to work on 
your sense of shame.

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:49.920
Huh?

00:20:51.150 --> 00:20:54.100
Even if you were wearing 
a swimsuit underneath,

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:59.020
it's not good for a girl to tear off 
her clothes in front of a crowd like that.

00:20:59.350 --> 00:21:01.590
It shows too much vulnerability.

00:21:01.590 --> 00:21:04.030
You should be more 
aware of your feminine—

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:16.780
I did it again...

00:21:21.720 --> 00:21:24.670
Why can't I be honest about my feelings?

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:28.350
Hayate!

00:21:28.710 --> 00:21:31.310
I'm hungry!

00:21:31.620 --> 00:21:34.130
Yes, yes. It's almost ready.

00:21:34.580 --> 00:21:38.180
By the way, Hayate-kun, 
how are your studies going?

00:21:38.180 --> 00:21:40.510
If you have time, I'd like 
to ask you for a favor later.

00:21:40.510 --> 00:21:42.470
Sure, that's fine.

00:21:42.470 --> 00:21:45.770
Thanks to Hinagiku-san, 
my studies have been...

00:21:52.400 --> 00:21:55.700
Now my shoulders really are stiff...

00:21:55.700 --> 00:21:56.920
Hinagiku-san.

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:02.000
Hayate-kun...

00:22:03.230 --> 00:22:04.630
What are you doing here?

00:22:05.300 --> 00:22:07.130
Shall I rub your shoulders?

00:22:07.570 --> 00:22:09.630
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:22:09.630 --> 00:22:11.530
Th-They're not stiff or anything...

00:22:19.350 --> 00:22:20.270
You will?

00:22:20.790 --> 00:22:22.520
Yes, I'd be glad to.

00:22:27.230 --> 00:22:29.040
Thanks, Hayate-kun.

00:22:29.390 --> 00:22:31.530
You're welcome.

00:24:05.790 --> 00:24:08.380
Now I'm giving you 
a Cutie Touch, just kidding!

00:24:08.380 --> 00:24:09.560
What are you doing, Hina-chan?

00:24:09.560 --> 00:24:11.540
I-Izumi! I'm not doing anything!

00:24:11.540 --> 00:24:13.010
Hey, Hina, do that thing!

00:24:13.010 --> 00:24:14.130
Cutie Touch!

00:24:14.130 --> 00:24:15.430
You leave me no choice.

00:24:15.430 --> 00:24:16.460
Nice Cutie!

00:24:16.460 --> 00:24:18.300
Cutie Mate! Hey!

00:24:18.300 --> 00:24:20.060
Ah, that scared me....
